      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Objective:

    Collect valuable items to meet your quota.

    - Drop
    the items near the starting room of the dungeon.

    - If all players die, the
    mission is failed.

    - If you fail to meet the quota, the mission is failed.


    Item
    Weight:

    Each item has a specific weight, which determines how many inventory
    slots it occupies. If an item takes up more than one slot, you''ll notice a slightly
    opaque duplicate of the item to the right of its current slot.

    To pick up
    an item, ensure that there are enough empty slots available to the right (the
    number of free slots should be at least the item''s weight minus one).


    As
    you carry heavier items, your movement speed will decrease, and you may eventually
    become unable to jump.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
